{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S08、S11、S12这类只有20至25秒的段落仍然偏密，X的左右分栏更容易一眼扫完。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的优势是左右分栏明确，快速扫读比较省力；但右侧感受词容易变成一堆需要自行拼接的标签。Y通过重点词加亮、话与感受交替，以及感受随音乐进程出现，让观众更容易抓住每次心理转折，也更清楚他为什么从不甘、怀念、孤独走向不再逼自己选边。尤其Y对音乐细节与人物感受的对应更具体，前后反复出现的亲近、受气、害怕孤单和继续向前也形成了完整的情感脉络。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6451488d-8905-4975-b19c-68955ea0c181", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T182847392403Z", "elapsed_seconds": 77.187, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:30:04.591729+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b0e13c31d354362c9a5b45eb2bf963f0598d6d0ea96d6ddf6204c7f5ad80eed0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "